# Cease // Desist, cast as Cease: "Exile up to two target cards from a single graveyard. Target player gains 2 life and
# draws a card." Bot2's graveyard holds two Lightning Bolts (it Bolted Bot1 on turns 2 and 4), Bot1's holds the one it Bolted
# Bot2 with on turn 3. On turn 5 Bot1 casts Cease on Bot2's two Bolts, naming itself as the player: both Bolts leave Bot2's
# graveyard for exile, Bot1's own Bolt is untouched, and Bot1 gains 2 life (14 after two Bolts, so 16) and draws one card.
# The cast half is a card of its own in the graveyard (CR 709.4), not a half.

